    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Departures are moments that evoke both hope and melancholy. This examines how these ambivalent emotions continue to persist long beyond that singular moment of parting. Azuma reminisces about her mentor as she sees off her own student; Kumeno recalls her short, turbulent friendship with Koizumi; Yukari meets an old friend during the Lantern Festival; and Sakurada fondly remembers the numerous students she has met during her teaching career.",
        "jpn": "旅街レイトショーとは、『別れ』をテーマにした4編からなるオムニバス形式のオリジナルアニメである。"
